# E §6.3: "a pair of rows stated same is one movement: the ledger lists it once, on one line, and names both rows";
# L §5.19 One movement on two statements: "each end is booked once, from the statement that covers it". One transfer
# of 950.00 on konto's statement (a2) and on sav's (b1), stated same, both fulfilling save[2026-03] (M2 patch case
# P35, P42, G4's review L1, its probe l_s_agree): konto's ledger observes -950.00, a2's end, as konto's balance and
# flows do (refcore counted b1's konto end too: observed -1 900.00, difference -950.00); sav's 950.00, b1's end.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-04-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input bank: observed
input keep: money PLN
input d_save: int

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_save)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to sav amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto) - keep)

ask q_flk: flows(konto, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31)
ask q_led: residuals konto 2026-03
ask q_ls: residuals sav 2026-03

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  keep = 100.00 PLN "s"
  d_save = 15 "s"
  opening[konto] = 1050.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  bank[a2] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "a"

version st_sav
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  covers sav
  bank[b1] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "b"
  same bank[a2] = bank[b1]
=== expect
q_flk: -950.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-10
q_led: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model -950.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model -950.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-10
q_ls: residuals sav 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model 950.00 PLN, observed 950.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model 950.00 PLN, observed 950.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-10
